OWNERSHIP AND AUTHORSHIP

This software, including all source code, architecture, methodology,
forensic frameworks, signal processing algorithms, visualization
systems, correlation engines, and documentation (collectively, the
"Software"), was designed, architected, and specified solely by
Christopher Thomas Williams.

Artificial intelligence tools were used exclusively for code
generation under the inventor's complete and detailed technical
direction. Such tools performed no architectural reasoning, exercised
no creative or inventive judgment, and made no decisions regarding the
scope, structure, strategy, or methodology of this Software. This is
consistent with and confirmed by the declaration filed with USPTO
Patent Application No. 19/466,387.

All inventive concepts, sensor architecture, correlation methodology,
classification taxonomy, forensic visualization design, curvature
analysis methodology, W-pattern detection framework, multi-layer
anomaly detection architecture, ellipse geometry analysis, and
ClockAnchor timestamp methodology were conceived and specified solely
by Christopher Thomas Williams.

